# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Dearly routes with the URL hash (#/library, #/write/<id>), so the application
# itself needs no server rewriting. This fallback exists only so that a hand-typed
# or bookmarked path still lands on the app instead of a 404.
#
# It is deliberately placed last and uses a 200 rewrite rather than a redirect.
# Cloudflare Pages serves real files and Function routes first, so downloads,
# assets, /api/* Functions, _headers and the service worker are never shadowed
# by this rule.

